  "design": {
    "idea": "Submerged Lens-Well foundation: cross the north ledge to clear a stranded Reef Skate at low tide, rotate the sunken mirror dry on its sandbar, then spin the Brass Tide-Wheel to mid to flood the shaft, float the indoor Skiff & tide bridge, and bank a blue bolt into the well shutter to reach Relay F1 (r12).",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "Switching tower_tide between low (exposing sunken mirrors) and mid (floating tidal causeways and indoor Skiffs).",
